<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-1/8 (FIM 194.96).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-1/8 (FIM 194.96).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed down $0-1/8 at $43-1/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 194.96 markka. In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia closed down 0.80 markka at 194.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed down $0-1/4 at $32-3/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.18 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.80 markka at 73.20.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was again untraded in New York. Its last close was flat at $21 on Wednesday last week. Rauma fell 1.00 markka to 94.50 in Helsinki on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
